	'representatives were lined up.'
	\L_0519d:
	\L_05190:
	\L_05078:
	ZH 1:
	'So Ran, you’re leading a new'
	R
	'magic warrior unit. Still'
	R
	'small, but training soldiers'
	R
	'is your duty too. Okay?'
	\L_0519d:
	\L_05190:
	!VAR0516 : 66!
	\L_0513c:
	\L_050e8:
	ZH 1:
	'Yes.'
	\L_0519d:
	\L_05190:
	\L_05078:
	ZH 1:
